  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Lily is in the garden. \"Hello!\" says Lily. A small brown dog looks at her. It is Pip. \"Woof!\" says Pip. Lily is happy. Tom comes. \"Hi, Pip!\" says Tom.",
      "Mia comes too. Mia is a girl. She is Lily's friend. \"Hi, Lily!\" says Mia. \"Hi, Tom!\" says Mia. \"Who is this?\" \"This is Pip,\" says Lily. \"What is his name?\" asks Mia. \"His name is Pip.\" Pip is a boy dog.",
      "\"Pip is small,\" says Mia. \"He is brown.\" \"Yes, he is,\" says Tom. \"Do you like him?\" \"I love Pip!\" says Mia. Pip says, \"Woof!\" \"Goodbye, Mia!\" says Lily. \"Goodbye, Pip!\" says Mia."
    ],
    "summary": "Lily says hello to Pip in the garden. Her friend Mia comes and asks his name. Then they say goodbye.",
